step	90	-	Quick guide step 90
line	<str>Travel to Burgh de Rott.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the pub basement.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-east to the docks where there's a hut with a boat in it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a plank on the boat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a plank on the boat chute.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the boat down the chute.</str>
line	
line	<str>Board the boat.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north-west a short distance (still on the pier), search the floor then kick it down and climb down.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb over the wall rubble and talk to any Meiyerditch citizen.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Old Man Ral to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the ladder in the building south-west of Old Man Ral.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump south to the floorboards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump east to the floorboards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the north-east corner of the room, push the wall and go across the gap.</str>
line	
line	<str>Crawl under the wall to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north to the second room, look on the west side, push the wall and walk across it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the table next to the wall, open the trapdoor table, and climb into it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the shelf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Crawl under the wall to the east side.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump to the floorboards to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the pots near the eastern door to get a door key and use it to open the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the ladder in the room to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump south to the floorboards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go east, south, west and climb up the shelf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump south again to the floorboards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go east through the rooms and walk across the washing line.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Push the wall to the north and walk across the floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the shelf to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the shelf on the north-eastern side, below the floor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump to the floorboards to the north-west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump to the floorboards to the north.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north-west and then east (around a gap in the floor) and jump to the floorboards.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb up the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the western wall to find a ladder top.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the ladder you came up, then repair the nearby broken ladder using the ladder top. Then climb down the fixed ladder. You are now in sector three.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the door and go north and slightly west, then north to a house with a fireplace in it. (go up the ladder if you need a knife)</str>
line	
line	<str>Go west through the door into the next room, then north out of the house until you see a barricade.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go east past the sickle logo and the house directly south should have a ladder inside. Climb up the ladder.</str>
line	
line	<str>Jump to the floorboards to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the stairs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south along the eastern side of the stairs. Search the wall. Use your knife on the wall, then push it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Press the decorated wall on the northern side.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the lumpy rug (south-east square of the green rug).</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb down the trapdoor to enter the hideout.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run north and talk to Vertida Sefalatis.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel back to Burgh de Rott.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the pub basement.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to the Paterdomus Temple (fairy ring CKS).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Drezel in Paterdomus, underneath the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the west exit, past the monuments.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the bush slightly south-west of the steps leading to the temple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wait for the cutscene to finish.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to speak with Drezel. He will give you runes to use Varrock Teleport.</str>
line	
line	<str>Teleport or travel to Varrock and talk to King Roald in the palace. The king will teleport you back to Paterdomus if you ask the right question.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel back to Burgh de Rott.</str>
